{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly Heart Gambit is a First-Person Anime Gambling Visual Novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alice-sama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very fun card game (created by Alice-sama)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 chapters of story (featuring Alice-sama)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 endings and 1 hidden secret</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time is running out</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I know. The doctor said you have only 3 months left to live. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to gamble for more time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game is very simple</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/extras/a1.png?t=1737108202\" />I will give you time for every card you draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>However</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/extras/a22.png?t=1737108202\" />You lose your time when you draw a joker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you lose all your time, your heart will be mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How to avoid losing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/extras/storegif_new__1_.png?t=1737108202\" />You keep every card you draw. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can pass your turn by playing a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you don\u2019t want to avoid losing to me, because you want to give me your heart, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you sure you want to leave?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/extras/storegif_dg.png?t=1737108202\" />I\u2019ll give you more time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join me in an eternal game, where we play forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">just me and you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">alice forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">alice forever alice forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">alice forever alice forever alice forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">alice forever alice forever alice forever alice forever</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deadly Heart Gambit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356820/98c2e00bead046e2b3290ce64a725d6ff0110c17.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356820?t=1737108202","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356820?t=1737108202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/c34e8dddbf4a415bb2ac7059d80edaf687ae0254/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737108202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356820/c34e8dddbf4a415bb2ac7059d80edaf687ae0254/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737108202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly Heart Gambit is a First-Person Anime Gambling Visual Novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alice-sama</p></li><li><p class=\